flowchart TD
    START([User opens Bellomassi]) --> LOGIN{Which sign-in page?}
    LOGIN -->|/login| OFFICE[Office web app]
    LOGIN -->|/driver/login| DRVAPP[Driver app]
    LOGIN -->|/customer/login| CUSTAPP[Customer app]

    OFFICE --> DASH[Role dashboard with period filter]
    DASH --> MASTER[Master data: products, customers, hubs, zones, suppliers]
    DASH --> INV[Inventory: receipts, transfers, adjustments, scrap]
    DASH --> ORD[Create order - Sales Executive]
    CUSTAPP --> CORD[Place order from cart - Customer]

    ORD --> SUB[Order SUBMITTED, approval PENDING]
    CORD --> SUB
    SUB --> APR{Sales Manager decision}
    APR -->|Return| RET[RETURNED for correction] --> ORD
    APR -->|Reject| REJ([REJECTED - end])
    APR -->|Approve| APP[APPROVED]

    APP --> CONS[Customer Service verifies 5 checks and consolidates]
    CONS --> CON[CONSOLIDATED]
    CON --> RDY[Mark READY_FOR_DISPATCH]
    RDY --> PLAN[Dispatcher plans dispatch: orders, zone, sequence]
    PLAN --> ASG[Assign driver and vehicle - compliance checks]
    ASG --> CONF[Confirm dispatch: stock deducted, deliveries created]
    CONF --> DRVAPP
    DRVAPP --> START2[Start delivery: OUT_FOR_DELIVERY, DEMO GPS]
    START2 --> ARR[Reach location: OTP issued - simulated]
    ARR --> OTP{OTP correct?}
    OTP -->|No| ARR
    OTP -->|Yes| QTY{All quantities delivered?}
    QTY -->|Yes| DEL[DELIVERED + delivery note]
    QTY -->|No| PDEL[PARTIALLY_DELIVERED + delivery note]
    START2 -->|Problem at stop| FAIL[DELIVERY_FAILED]
    FAIL --> REV[Dispatcher reviews exception]
    PDEL --> REV
    REV -->|Return stock| RTH[RETURNED_TO_HUB]
    REV -->|Return and re-queue| RDY

    APP --> INVC[Finance issues invoice]
    DEL --> INVC
    PDEL --> INVC
    INVC --> CUSTDOC[Customer sees delivery note and invoice in the customer app]

    DEL --> RPT[Dashboards and Reports Center]
    INVC --> RPT
    INV --> RPT
